  "prompts": {
    "states": "Production game sprite sheet of EXACT attached NRG armored containment-suit form from Ben 10. Preserve round sealed bronze-brown helmet with THREE vivid green vertical grille bars in a black rectangular face vent, no eyes/mouth/human face; bulky brown shoulder pauldrons, brown chest with green Omnitrix, segmented brown gauntlet fists, dark flexible elbows/hips, rounded brown armored boots. Compact heavy armored silhouette. Clean original cartoon black outlines, flat bronze-brown colors and one cel shadow tone, no painterly texture. Exactly EIGHT separate whole-body right-facing/three-quarter figures in 4 columns x 2 rows with clear transparent gutters and at least 25px margins. Row-major: 1 ultimate preparation widening stance and lifting fists; 2 ultimate active reactor flare posture, feet braced and arms spread, SEALED helmet and face grille still intact; 3 ultimate recover guard; 4 neutral standing fists low in guard; 5 blocking guard with forearms crossed; 6 UPRIGHT hit recoil leaning back but feet planted; 7 defeated lying on side, one connected intact armored body; 8 dash heavy forward lean with fists tucked and knees bent. ALL poses same helmet, grille, chest, limbs and scale. NO unarmored energy form. No radiation painted over body, flames, green beams, halos, motion trails, floor, dust, shadow, text or labels. Truly transparent background. Desired upright body height 350-430px in 1536x1024 or higher, do not clip helmet, gauntlets or boots.",
